  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The editor defect is still present. `Expanded` is read as a Boolean at runtime, but `Minimap|Expanded` is absent from the editor's Boolean-setting list. The editor renders a switch only when that list contains the section and key, so this setting still renders as the wrong input type.\n\nThe current static verifier is a false positive. It only checks that the word `Expanded` appears somewhere in the schema. The label entry satisfies that test even though it does not make the control a switch.\n\nThis proves the editor-schema bug. It is not a runtime zoom result.",
